Package: golfastr
Type: Package
Title: Efficiently Access Pro Golf Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ray", "Carpenter", email = "raymondcarpenter1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Designed for quickly grabbing PGA Tour data. Includes a large data
    update with shot-level PGA Tour 'ShotLink' data, tee times and course setup,
    strokes gained, win probability after every hole, a what's in the bag
    database (WITBDB) of player equipment, an ID crosswalk between 'ESPN' and
    the PGA Tour, and logo image URLs. Leaderboards and hole-by-hole scoring
    come from 'ESPN' <https://www.espn.com/golf/> for the PGA Tour, LIV Golf,
    LPGA, DP World Tour and Champions Tour. Completed seasons are served from
    hosted files for fast repeated access, and data can be saved as RDS, 'Apache
    Arrow' Parquet or a 'SQLite' database.
